    <string name="roguelike_relic_fireball_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage, then burns the target for %3$d turns (a quarter of the hit each turn). Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_ice_shard_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage and can freeze the target for %3$d turn: its attack is delayed. It sometimes resists — high INT and a good swipe make that rarer. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_lightning_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage and paralyzes the target for %3$d turns: each of its attacks can fall flat (magic still gets through). High INT and a good swipe make that more likely. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_venom_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage and adds a dose of poison (3 at most): each dose eats %5$d HP per turn for %3$d turns. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <!-- Le grimoire : reliques du 18/09/2026 (voir DONJON.md, « Le grimoire ») -->
    <string name="roguelike_relic_sunder">Sunder</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_war_cry">War Cry</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_earthquake">Earthquake</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_hunters_mark">Hunter\'s Mark</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_poisoned_blades">Poisoned Blades</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_freezing_rain">Freezing Rain</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_chain_lightning">Chain Lightning</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_sunder_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage (no element) and fractures the target for %3$d turns: it takes 25%% more damage from everything. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_war_cry_desc">Weakens every enemy for %3$d turns (their blows hit 30%% softer), and your next 2 weapon attacks deal +%7$d%%. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_earthquake_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage (no element) to every enemy. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_hunters_mark_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage (no element) and marks the target until it dies: your critical hits strike it harder, and your Deadly Strike finds its opening. When it dies, the mark jumps to another enemy. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_poisoned_blades_desc">Coats your weapon: each of your next %3$d weapon hits adds a dose of poison (3 at most), eating %5$d HP per turn. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_freezing_rain_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage to every enemy and soaks them for %3$d turns: they resist control less, and water reacts with other elements. It puts out fires. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_chain_lightning_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage to the target, then leaps to every other enemy, losing 30%% at each leap. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>

