    <string name="roguelike_relic_rend_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage (no element) and opens a wound for %3$d turns: the target loses %8$d HP every time it attacks. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_whirlwind_desc">A weapon strike on every enemy: %1$d–%2$d damage each (no element). Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_fan_of_knives_desc">Throws daggers at every enemy: %1$d–%2$d damage each (no element). A critical dagger opens a wound (%8$d HP each time the target attacks). Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_smoke_bomb_desc">Blinds every enemy for %3$d turns (they attack with disadvantage), and your next weapon attack is a sneak attack: a guaranteed critical. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_acid_flask_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage, adds a dose of poison (%5$d HP per turn) and fractures the target for %3$d turns: it takes 25%% more damage from everything. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_crystallize_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d damage — three times as much to a frozen target, whose ice then shatters. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_meteor_desc">Calls a meteor that falls %3$d turns later on every enemy: %1$d–%2$d fire damage each. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_magic_missile_desc">Three arcane bolts, each on a random enemy, sharing %1$d–%2$d damage. Never resisted. Recharge: %4$d turn.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_arcane_shield_desc">A barrier absorbs the next %8$d damage. If it still holds when your turn comes back, your relics recharge one turn faster. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_holy_light_desc">Deals %1$d–%2$d holy damage and blinds the target for %3$d turn. The undead fear it. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_regeneration_desc">Heals %8$d HP at each of your next %3$d turns. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_stoneskin_desc">For %3$d turns your armor is doubled, and every blow you take sends %8$d%% back to its author. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>
    <string name="roguelike_relic_charm_desc">The target\'s next attack hits one of its allies instead (alone, it loses it). It sometimes resists. Recharge: %4$d turns.</string>

